    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transverse The Forgotten Kingdoms</h2></strong><br><br>On the isolated island of Solis, the history of many past kingdoms thrive and fallen throughout the years frozen in time.<br><br>Amo is a 2D top-down metroidvania action adventure on an seemingly deserted island. But not everything is as it seems. Explore old kingdoms, open seas, and the heavens to find a way off the island and learn of your past.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Transverse the overworld, underworld, and the sky above to leave the island in one piece.<br></li><li>Solve the puzzles with flight, bombs, and your trusty whip throughout the journey.<br></li><li>Help stranded souls with side quests to finally rest in peace.<br></li><li>Over 700 unique rooms<br></li><li>Fight over a variety of 40 Bosses across the lands.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transverse The Forgotten Kingdoms</h2></strong><br><br>On the isolated island of Solis, the history of many past kingdoms thrive and fallen throughout the years frozen in time.<br><br>Amo is a 2D top-down metroidvania action adventure on an seemingly deserted island. But not everything is as it seems. Explore old kingdoms, open seas, and the heavens to find a way off the island and learn of your past.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Transverse the overworld, underworld, and the sky above to leave the island in one piece.<br></li><li>Solve the puzzles with flight, bombs, and your trusty whip throughout the journey.<br></li><li>Help stranded souls with side quests to finally rest in peace.<br></li><li>Over 700 unique rooms<br></li><li>Fight over a variety of 40 Bosses across the lands.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Amo is a top-down metroidvania, where a lost dog, Amo, gets stranded on an island. Explore the vast environments, fight through the enemies of the past, and solve the many mysteries that the island holds.",
